<title>POLAND: DROSED OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>DROSED OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.53 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.65 vs   1.00</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.48 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Sales		   14.73 vs   8.25</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.70 vs   5.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.52 vs   7.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.96 vs   6.55</p>
<p> Sales		  115.91 vs  76.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Drosed SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
